<% content_for :title, 'Request a Quote' %>
<% content_for :description, 'One form collects the essentials — the sales team follows up, completes the details and issues an official quote.' %>
<% content_for :nav_active, 'medical' %>


<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="page-hero__inner">
  
<div class="crumbs">
  <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">→</span><a href="/en/medical/">Medical Information</a><span class="sep">→</span><span class="here">Request a Quote</span>
</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Request a Formal Quotation</h1>
  <p class="page-hero__lead">The unified direct inquiry channel for licensed healthcare facilities, pharmacies, and aesthetic centers across the Kingdom. Account-opening documents are not requested here — the team asks for them after first contact.</p>
  
</div></div></section>

<section class="section section--last"><div class="container">
  <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:1.3fr .7fr;gap:18px;align-items:start">
    <form class="form-card" data-quote-form novalidate>
      <div data-form-body>
        <h3>Required fields</h3>
        <div class="form-grid">
          
<div class="field">
  <label for="name">Name <span class="req">*</span></label>
  <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Full name" required>
</div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Facility type <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <div class="choice-chips">
              <button type="button" class="cchip is-on">Aesthetic clinic</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">Polyclinic / hospital</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">Retail pharmacy</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">Care center</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          
<div class="field">
  <label for="facility">Facility name <span class="req">*</span></label>
  <input type="text" id="facility" name="facility" placeholder="As on the licence" required>
</div>
          
<div class="field">
  <label for="city">City <span class="req">*</span></label>
  <input type="text" id="city" name="city" placeholder="Riyadh, Jeddah, Dammam…" required>
</div>
          
<div class="field">
  <label for="phone">Mobile / WhatsApp <span class="req">*</span></label>
  <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="+966 5X XXX XXXX" required>
</div>
          
<div class="field">
  <label for="email">Email <span class="req">*</span></label>
  <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="name@clinic.sa" required>
</div>
          <div class="field field--wide">
            <label>Products of interest — multi-select <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <div class="choice-chips" data-multi>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">ReMedium® Fine</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">ReMedium® Mid</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">ReMedium® Sub-Q</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">HA Ophthalmic</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">Korean skincare lines</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-top:28px">Optional fields</h3>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field">
            <label>Estimated initial volume</label>
            <div class="choice-chips">
              <button type="button" class="cchip">Trial order (1–10 units)</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">Small batch (11–50 units)</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">Bulk supply (50+ units)</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Do you already work with us?</label>
            <div class="choice-chips">
              <button type="button" class="cchip">Yes</button>
              <button type="button" class="cchip">No</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <label class="checkbox-row field--wide"><input type="checkbox" name="visit">Yes, request an in-clinic sales representative visit</label>
          
<div class="field field--wide">
  <label for="notes">Notes</label>
  <textarea id="notes" name="notes" placeholder="Anything you would like to add…"></textarea>
</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:22px">
          <label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" data-consent>I agree to the <a href="/en/legal/privacy/" style="color:var(--green-600);font-weight:700">Privacy Policy</a> and processing of facility data.</label>
          <label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" name="eligibility">I acknowledge that supply and wholesale medical orders are strictly restricted to licensed healthcare entities and accredited facilities.</label>
          <div><button type="submit" class="btn btn--green">Send request<span class="btn__circle"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 17L7 7"></path><path d="M7 14V7h7"></path></svg></span></button></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="thanks" data-form-thanks hidden>
        <b>Thank you — your request has been received.</b>
        <p>A Beauty Roots medical sales representative will review your inquiry and provide a formal quotation within 24 business hours.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--warn-ink)">Technical note: this form is front-end only for now — actual submission (email + request log) is wired in the backend phase.</p>
      </div>
    </form>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
      <div class="dark-strip" style="padding:28px 30px">
        <h3 style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:14px">After you send</h3>
        <ul style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)"><span style="color:#7FE3BE;margin-top:4px"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 7"></path></svg></span><span>A thank-you screen confirming a formal quotation within 24 business hours.</span></li><li style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)"><span style="color:#7FE3BE;margin-top:4px"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 7"></path></svg></span><span>An automatic confirmation email to the sender.</span></li><li style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)"><span style="color:#7FE3BE;margin-top:4px"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 7"></path></svg></span><span>An instant notification to the sales team’s email and number.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div style="margin-top:18px"><a class="btn btn--green" href="https://wa.me/966562017170">In a hurry? WhatsApp<span class="btn__circle"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.5 15.3L2 22l4.9-1.4A10 10 0 1 0 12 2zm4.8 13.9c-.2.6-1.2 1.2-1.7 1.2-.4.1-1 .1-1.6-.1-.4-.1-.9-.3-1.5-.6-2.6-1.1-4.3-3.8-4.4-4-.1-.2-1.1-1.4-1.1-2.7s.7-1.9.9-2.2c.2-.2.5-.3.7-.3h.5c.2 0 .4 0 .6.4l.9 2.1c.1.2.1.4 0 .6l-.4.6-.5.5c-.2.2-.3.4-.1.7.2.3.8 1.3 1.7 2.1 1.2 1.1 2.2 1.4 2.5 1.5.3.1.5.1.7-.1l1-1.2c.2-.3.4-.2.7-.1l2 1c.3.1.5.2.5.3.1.2.1.6-.1 1.2z"></path></svg></span></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="note-strip"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5-7-10V6z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg><p>Behind the scenes: all requests land in one exportable table with a status per request (new · contacted · closed), and the visit source is logged with each request so we know which pages actually bring leads — with bot protection and no intrusive captcha.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

